{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐细节明显不如X丰富，具体声部、音型、音色变化和情绪转折的细微听觉提示有所减少。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句和【】高亮让人更容易迅速扫到情绪锚点，但大量感受碎片容易让注意力分散，心理过程也有些被切断。Y把试探、害怕给对方负担、得到回应后的放松、害怕失去，以及最后决定不再隐藏，连成了更自然的心理因果链，普通观众更容易理解人物为什么这样行动，以及前后经历如何变化。X在音乐细节和细微感受上更有层次，但综合观看体验，我更愿意选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "36eb07ad-daf7-4fea-8316-f26c2b8193b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T123713186630Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T12:39:17.401599+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2db5000f8f51623cf92474ec760452da4006b021617ec9e51f7c9242c8a7072f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "